# Viewer build settings (read by `npm run dev` and `npm run build`; copy to .env).
#
# The agent's public base URL. Leave empty when the viewer and the agent share
# one site (the dev server, or nginx proxying /agent): calls go to /agent on it.
# Set it when the agent has its own address; that origin must then be listed in
# the agent's AGENT_CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_AGENT_URL=
# One of the agent's AGENT_API_KEYS, sent with every call. It ends up in the
# built JavaScript, readable by anyone who can load the viewer: it identifies
# this app, it doesn't keep people out. Put the viewer behind your sign-in.
VITE_AGENT_API_KEY=
